    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n64044" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λῠγόω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>tie fast</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱμάντι κατ᾽ αὐχένος ἅμμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					9.150
				</span></i>
			 (Antip.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλυκτοπέδῃσι λυγωθείς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>APl.</u>
					1.15
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>bend, overpower</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Δανάας ἐλύγωσεν ὅδε φρένα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					5.216
				</span></i>
			 (Paul. Sil.).</div>
